Tokenizer: the tokens of the PHP parser, for PHP source code.

The module tokenizer of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20240924/tokenizer.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d,
its headers in include/php84/php/ext/tokenizer.
